cover.out
portable.txt

# Built binaries. `go build ./cmd/xrdesk` with no -o writes one HERE, named
# after the package, and a 22 MB file in a repository is 22 MB in every clone
# for ever. One was committed that way; see the commit that removed it.
/xrdesk
/deskchaos
/deskcheck
/build/

# The application bundle. `go run ./cmd/macapp` writes a signed 22 MB bundle to
# dist/ by DEFAULT, and the rule above names build/ -- the directory the bundle
# used to go in. An ignore rule that names yesterday's output directory protects
# nothing.
/dist/
